><i class="gf_icon fa fa-circle"></i></div></div></div></div></li><li class="item" style="width: 20px;"><div data-index="6" data-key="content" class="item-content"><div data-label="Icon" id="e-1629018999118" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-icon" data-id="1629018999118" data-ver="1.0"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><div class="gf_icon-wrap" style="color: rgb(152, 178, 128);"><i class="gf_icon fa fa-circle"></i></div></div></div></div></li><li class="item" style="width: 20px;"><div data-index="7" data-key="content" class="item-content"><div data-label="Icon" id="e-1629018999147" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-icon" data-id="1629018999147" data-ver="1.0"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-exc=""><div class="gf_icon-wrap" style="color: rgb(152, 178, 128);"><i class="gf_icon fa fa-circle"></i></div></div></div></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1629018999116" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1629018999116"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>今日から簡単に始められるサステナブルな活動を提案するコーナーです。</p><p><span style="color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; text-align: inherit;">まずは１週間、私たちと一緒に活動してみませんか？</span><br></p><p><br></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"></span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">今週は➡</span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><strong><span style="font-size: 22px;"><br></span></strong></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"></span><strong><span style="font-size: 22px;">　　　　　 　　　　～</span></strong></span><strong style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 22px;"><font color="#000000" face="Roboto, RobotoDraft, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">近い産地の食材を選ぼう</span></font></span></strong><strong style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 22px;">～</span></strong></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: center;"><strong style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-size: 14px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 22px;"><br></span></strong></p></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1629622686575" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1629622686575"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left" data-gemlang="en"><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 14px;">「近い産地の食材を選ぶ」これのどこがサステナブルなの？そう思った方もいるのではないでしょうか？</span></font></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif">産地の近くで消費することで、輸送や保冷、保温に関わるエネルギーの消費を抑えることが出来、CO2排出削減に繋がります。</font></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><font face="arial, helvetica, sans-serif">もちろん、新鮮な食材を手にすることが出来、地域応援にもつながるのでいいこと尽くしですね！</font></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;">これを機に、食材の産地を気にしてもらえたら嬉しいです！</p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><br></span></span></p><p style="padding-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">KAPOK KNOTのInstagramでもメンバーのチャレンジを発信していきます 。</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/kapok_knot_jp/" style="max-width: 100%; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration-line: underline; overflow-wrap: break-word !important;" aria-describedby="a11y-external-message"><strong>@kapok_knot_jp</strong></a>をタグ付けして<strong>#kapokaction</strong>で是非SNSに投稿お願いいたします！</span></span></p><p style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;"><br></span></span></p></div></div><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" id="e-1629018999160" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpico